 # Changelog
 
+## v4.2.7
+
+- Resolve Threads Android `/share/<token>` aliases to canonical, tracking-free post permalinks through an optional privacy-scoped edge resolver.
+- Never treat a Threads `/share/` alias as the final clean/share URL after resolution succeeds.
+- Keep a local fallback when the resolver is unavailable.
+- Add a hardened Cloudflare Worker resolver that validates every redirect hop and never forwards user cookies.
+
 ## v4.2.6
 - Treat Threads Android `https://www.threads.com/share/<id>` payloads as supported Threads share aliases instead of incorrectly showing **Unsupported share**.
 - Prefer an exact `/@user/post/<id>` permalink when a share payload contains both a Threads share alias and a canonical post URL.
